Deployment Architecture
Overview
The deployment architecture is designed to support:

Desktop clients
Mobile clients
Future VR clients
Realm separation
Horizontal scaling
Centralized moderation
High availability
Future global expansion
The system follows a cloud-native deployment model using containerized backend services.

